  "description": "Our final CRIT frame batch is now sold out, but please check below for available In Stock frames – these still have customisable routing and finish.\n\nrAwrAw finish frames available online or at Seabass Cycles.\n\nThe Stayer CRIT is a high-performance steel road and track racing frame, designed and hand-built at our East London workshop. Born out of the London crit racing scene, it’s built to be light, stiff, and razor-sharp — delivering explosive power transfer and precise handling, while still offering enough comfort to carry you through long race days.\n\nCrafted from Columbus Spirit HSS tubing and paired with a carbon fork, the CRIT is everything you’d want from a modern steel race frame: fast, responsive, and made to last.\n\nEvery frame is phosphate-dipped for rust protection, then powder-coated with UV-stable colours and a choice of gloss or matt topcoat.",
